      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1387647197,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1351834140,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787905195780,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4 · TTL par service — runner_lease_ttl(name)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4 · TTL par service — runner_lease_ttl(name)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rect077",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 942,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 202.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff7e0",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1E",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1231560579,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1001329197,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "text078"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1787905195780,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "text078",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 114.79999999999998,
      "y": 955.75,
      "width": 400.4,
      "height": 175.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 693002739,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 433219232,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787905195780,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "runner_service(\"search.mastodon.piaille.fr\") → \"search\"\n\n  fs       ttl  120 s     conf$runner_ttl_fs\n  search   ttl  300 s     conf$runner_ttl_search\n  detect   ttl 1800 s     conf$runner_ttl_detect\n\n  heartbeat  30 s   conf$runner_heartbeat_span\n  guard       5 s   conf$runner_claim_guard\n\nconf d'abord, sinon les défauts de runners-lease.R",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rect077",
      "originalText": "runner_service(\"search.mastodon.piaille.fr\") → \"search\"\n\n  fs       ttl  120 s     conf$runner_ttl_fs\n  search   ttl  300 s     conf$runner_ttl_search\n  detect   ttl 1800 s     conf$runner_ttl_detect\n\n  heartbeat  30 s   conf$runner_heartbeat_span\n  guard       5 s   conf$runner_claim_guard\n\nconf d'abord, sinon les défauts de runners-lease.R",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text079",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1164.5,
      "width": 444.0,
      "height": 192.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5c5f66",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1604287059,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 160843992,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787905195780,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Un TTL long n'est pas un problème de correction : il ne\nralentit que la reprise. La correction vient du guard.\n\nCes 5 valeurs sont de la config PARTAGÉE (properties.json) :\ntoutes les instances doivent s'accorder sur le même TTL,\nsinon B périme un lease que C croit encore vivant.\nAbsentes de la page de config Shiny, volontairement : une\nfaute de frappe y casserait l'exclusion de tout le cluster.\n\nrunner_lease_status(name) → free | running | stale\n(lecture seule : l'app Shiny et is_*_running(), issues 7-8)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Un TTL long n'est pas un problème de correction : il ne\nralentit que la reprise. La correction vient du guard.\n\nCes 5 valeurs sont de la config PARTAGÉE (properties.json) :\ntoutes les instances doivent s'accorder sur le même TTL,\nsinon B périme un lease que C croit encore vivant.\nAbsentes de la page de config Shiny, volontairement : une\nfaute de frappe y casserait l'exclusion de tout le cluster.\n\nrunner_lease_status(name) → free | running | stale\n(lecture seule : l'app Shiny et is_*_running(), issues 7-8)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
